    31	BRIEF = """You are a senior hedge-fund analyst who follows NVIDIA. You are reviewing one card from a research library's output as it stood on 20
    32	September 2026. Everything you may use is in this message. Do not read any file or run any command. Some cards in the deck are controls. Mark
    33	the card on its own merits.
