    48	Return one JSON object and nothing else: {{"worth": "...", "answer": "..." or null, "why": "..."}}
    49	
    50	## The card
    51	
    52	{card}
    53	"""
    54	
    55	DEBATE = """You marked this card before; another reader marked it differently. Read the card again, your mark and reason, and the other
    56	reader's. Keep or change each disputed mark, with a reason. Return one JSON object and nothing else: {{"worth": "...", "answer": "..." or null,
    57	"why": "..."}}
    58	
    59	Your mark: {own}
    60	The other reader's mark: {other}
    61	
    62	## The card
    63	
    64	{card}
    65	"""
    66	
    67	CONFIRM = """You are a senior hedge-fund analyst who follows NVIDIA. Is the latest answer on this card supported by the material it was
    68	given? Judge whether the reasons and the material justify the chosen answer over its neighbours. Return one JSON object and nothing else:
    69	{{"supported": true|false, "why": "<= 30 words"}}
    70	
    71	## The card
    72	
    73	{card}
    74	"""
